Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:13:20 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ARM64: record baseline benchmark results

Five pure-shell workloads (arithmetic loop, string building, case
matching, function calls, 500 $(:) subshells), median of 5 runs each
for the native ARM64 build and the x64 build under emulation on the
same Snapdragon X Elite host. Scripts and the runner are kept in
benchmarks/scripts so the numbers can be reproduced.

Signed-off-by: aswin-mcw <aswin.kalies@multicorewareinc.com>
